    {
      "id": "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs014c01/fs014c01-09.txt/0",
      "source": "Even in \\c[52]The Book of the Unrivaled\\c[0],\r\nsame sex romance isn't prohibited.",
      "previous_translation": "就连\\c[52]《无双之书》\\c[0]里，\r\n也没有禁止同性恋爱。",
      "translation": "就连\\c[52]《绝伦之书》\\c[0]里，\r\n也没有禁止同性恋爱。"
    },
    {
      "id": "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs014c01/fs014c01-10.txt/0",
      "source": "...\\c[52]The Book of the Unrivaled\\c[0]?",
      "previous_translation": "……\\c[52]《无双之书》\\c[0]？",
      "translation": "……\\c[52]《绝伦之书》\\c[0]？"
    },
    {
      "id": "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs014c01/fs014c01-11.txt/0",
      "source": "Yes, I am on a journey to find \\c[52]The Book of the\r\nUnrivaled\\c[0], which is said to be somewhere in this realm.",
      "previous_translation": "是的，我正在寻找据说存在于\r\n这个世界的\\c[52]《无双之书》\\c[0]。",
      "translation": "是的，我正在寻找据说存在于\r\n这个世界的\\c[52]《绝伦之书》\\c[0]。"
    },
    {
      "id": "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs014c01/fs014c01-12.txt/0",
      "source": "And, what is the \\c[52]The Book of the Unrivaled\\c[0]?",
      "previous_translation": "那么，\\c[52]《无双之书》\\c[0]是什么？",
      "translation": "那么，\\c[52]《绝伦之书》\\c[0]是什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs014c02/fs014c02-07.txt/0",
      "source": "That's why all I can do is find \\c[52]The Book of the Unrivaled\\c[0]\r\nand increase my sexxx appeal.",
      "previous_translation": "所以我才要找到\\c[52]《无双之书》\\c[0]，\r\n提升自己的性感魅力。",
      "translation": "所以我才要找到\\c[52]《绝伦之书》\\c[0]，\r\n提升自己的性感魅力。"
    },
    {
      "id": "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs014c02/fs014c02-08.txt/0",
      "source": "Sex appeal? And okay, I'm gonna ask again,\r\nwhat is the \\c[52]The Book of the Unrivaled\\c[0]?",
      "previous_translation": "性感魅力？还有，我再说一次，\r\n\\c[52]《无双之书》\\c[0]到底是什么？",
      "translation": "性感魅力？还有，我再说一次，\r\n\\c[52]《绝伦之书》\\c[0]到底是什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs014c02/fs014c02-14.txt/0",
      "source": "Fiiiiiine, fine.\r\nUgh, if I could just get \\c[52]The Book of the Unrivaled\\c[0],\r\nI'd be doing a lot better.",
      "previous_translation": "好——好吧。\r\n唉，要是能得到\\c[52]《无双之书》\\c[0]，\r\n我现在肯定好过多了。",
      "translation": "好——好吧。\r\n唉，要是能得到\\c[52]《绝伦之书》\\c[0]，\r\n我现在肯定好过多了。"
    }
  ],
